cho(731, "—I called you at about half past eight last night, but nobody answered.\n—Oh, I ______ in my office at that time.", ["will work","was working","worked","had worked"], 1, "根据half past eight last night可判断用过去进行时，构成was/were+doing。因此选B项。")
fill(732, "用for或since填空：\n1. Jim has been in Ireland ______ five years ago.\n2. Jim has been in Ireland ______ three months.\n3. His aunt has lived in Australia ______ 15 days.\n4. Mary is in her office. She has been there ______ 7 o'clock in the morning.\n5. They have talked ______ two hours in the office.\n6. The bus is late. We have waited ______ 20 minutes.\n7. Nobody lives in those houses. They have been empty ______ many years.\n8. Mike has been ill ______ a long time. He has been in hospital ______ October.", "since；for；for；since；for；for；for；for；since", "for后接一段时间；since后接一个过去的时间点。five years ago/7 o'clock in the morning/October是过去时间点用since；three months/15 days/two hours/20 minutes/many years/a long time是一段时间用for。")
